# gui-app Module Rules

Reference: `docs/deck-spec.md`, `docs/tech-spec.md`. App root: `apps/gui-app` (Tauri + React).

## Modules & imports

- **No barrel files.** Do not add `index.ts` / `index.tsx` that only re-export, and do not import a folder as a module (`@/hooks/engine` → use `@/hooks/engine/useDeckLevels`; `@/components/deck` → use `@/components/deck/DeckPanel`). Import the concrete file path.
- Keep imports at the top of the file (no inline imports).
- Prefer the `@/` path alias for app source.
- Feature UI lives under domain folders: `deck/` (+ `deck/pads/`), `mixer/`, `library/`, `waveform/`, `shell/`, `dnd/`, `dialogs/`, plus existing `ui/` and `settings/`. See `docs/superpowers/specs/2026-08-02-gui-components-domain-layout-design.md`.

## UI

- Follow `docs/deck-spec.md` for deck layout and phased features.
- Use **coss** UI components and **toast** notifications (`toast.promise` for async startup); avoid verbose inline status text.
- Prefer minimal, focused UI diffs; match existing deck visual language.
- Pad mode grids: wrap pad buttons in `PadGridContainer`; mode components live under `src/components/deck/pads/` (no barrels).

## State & exhaustiveness

- Engine state syncs via engine events (e.g. MIDI); subscribe and render — do not invent a second source of truth.
- Prefer pattern matching with `ts-pattern` `match(...).exhaustive()` (or a `never` default) instead of a `switch` statement.

## Tooling

- Lint/format: package scripts `lint` / `lint:fix` / `format` / `format:check` (oxlint / oxfmt). Pre-commit uses root `format:staged` / `lint:staged` (affected staged files only).
